    "title": "UMD DOTS seeks community input to re-draw Shuttle-UM bus routes - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Clare Roth ,\n1 days ago For the first time in more than 20 years, DOTS is redesigning the Shuttle-UM system and asking for the university community’s input. In anticipation of the Purple Line’s introduction and other changes in transportation on campus, the Department of Transportation Services is working to restructure bus routes, according to its assistant director for marketing and communications Emily Cosci. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
